# Thresher environment template. Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Nothing is required for M0 (pure engine). All keys below arrive at M1+.

# Upstash Redis (cache + rate limiting) — M1
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Upstash Management API (OPTIONAL) — powers the quota panel on /internal.
# Create a Read-Only key in the Upstash Console → Account → Developer API.
# HTTP Basic auth: username = email, password = API key. UPSTASH_REDIS_ID is the
# database UUID (from the console URL, or `curl .../v2/redis/databases -u E:K`).
# Server-only secrets — never NEXT_PUBLIC. Absent => the quota panel is disabled.
# UPSTASH_EMAIL=
# UPSTASH_API_KEY=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_ID=

# Supabase (Postgres) — backs Follows (design: demand-driven universe).
# OPTIONAL. Follow-store selection is most-durable-first: Supabase (if set) →
# Upstash (if UPSTASH_* set — shared across Cloudflare isolates) → in-memory
# (per-isolate; fine for local/CI only). So on Cloudflare, follows persist via
# Upstash even without Supabase. Present here (URL + SERVICE_ROLE_KEY) => the
# Postgres backend; run apps/web/supabase/migrations/*.sql once (see MANUAL.md).
# The service-role key is server-only (never a NEXT_PUBLIC_ var).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Clerk (auth) — M2. Present => auth ON; absent => app runs open (dev/CI).
# Local dev uses the Clerk DEVELOPMENT instance keys (pk_test_/sk_test_);
# Cloudflare uses the PRODUCTION instance keys (pk_live_/sk_live_).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL=/sign-in
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_URL=/sign-up
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_FALLBACK_REDIRECT_URL=/leaderboard
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_FALLBACK_REDIRECT_URL=/leaderboard

# logo.dev (company / brokerage logos) — optional. Absent => monogram badges.
# Free publishable token (pk_...) from https://logo.dev. Attribution required on
# the free tier (a "Logos by Logo.dev" link is rendered in the footer).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_TOKEN=

# Scan cron — shared secret gating /api/cron/scan (the scheduled board refresh).
# Set the SAME random value as a Cloudflare RUNTIME var and a GitHub Actions
# secret (see MANUAL.md). Absent => the cron endpoint is disabled (503).
# CRON_SECRET=

# (monitoring deferred — see MANUAL.md)

